{"id":"20a7577a59efe440","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing10-side-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Side Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-side-condition — ZFC Forcing10 Side Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-side-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-side-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-side-condition — ZFC Forcing10 Side Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-countable]]","[[58-df-proper]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-side-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-side-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-side-condition — ZFC Forcing10 Side Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\theta,H,M,N,\\mathfrak H,\\mathfrak M\\in V\">\\(s,\\theta,H,M,N,\\mathfrak H,\\mathfrak M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span> (exact <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span> carrier and membership-structure predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation in the fixed membership language, inherited from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> (countability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SideCondition}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SideCondition}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}side\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SideCondition}_S(s,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\omega_1&lt;\\theta\\land\\exists H,\\mathfrak H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\\land s\\in[\\mathcal P(H)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall M\\in s\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\mathfrak H)\\land\\forall M,N\\in s\\;(M\\in N\\lor N\\in M\\lor M\\cap\\omega_1=N\\cap\\omega_1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}side\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SideCondition}_S(s,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\omega_1&lt;\\theta\\land\\exists H,\\mathfrak H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\\land s\\in[\\mathcal P(H)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall M\\in s\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\mathfrak H)\\land\\forall M,N\\in s\\;(M\\in N\\lor N\\in M\\lor M\\cap\\omega_1=N\\cap\\omega_1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The side condition is a finite family of countable elementary submodels of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> explicitly a regular uncountable cardinal.</li>\n<li>Typing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\mathcal P(H_\\theta)]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\mathcal P(H_\\theta)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> records that each model is a subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span> and elementarity are witnessed by the exact carrier/structure predicates, rather than by an unregistered set-as-structure expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\prec H_\\theta\">\\(M\\prec H_\\theta\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"